       the VFO panels' own 2..476: Main Rx starts where VFO A does and the Sub
       Rx dropdown ends where VFO B does, to the pixel. The Tx dropdown lands
       on 223, which is where the two panels meet.
       
       Proportional rather than padded, so it holds at whatever width the row
       is given rather than at the one it was measured at.
   
