    Change to a platform-independent fixed font

    Fix Pan button tooltip not showing on Windows once connected
       Setting WA_Hover on ToggleWidget's button fixes it: without it, Qt
       stopped generating Enter/HoverMove/ToolTip events for the button on
       Windows once connected to a K4, confirmed via event-filter
       diagnostics -- QApplication.widgetAt() still correctly and
       continuously identified the button under the cursor, but no hover
       events ever followed. No effect on Linux/macOS, where tooltips already
       worked without it.
       
