    Version v1.6.16.1

    Add Iambic B dit/dah memory delay percent settings
       Dit Mem % is the leading percent of a dah during which a dit
       paddle up event is ignored.  After that, a dit paddle up event
       will generate a final dit.
       
       Dah Mem % is the leading percent of a dit during which a dit
       paddle up event is ignored.  After that, a dah paddle up event
       will generate a final dah.
   
    Only debounce paddles for straight keying
       When keying with both paddles, there is no need for debouncing.
   
