       Updated Documentation/K4 Companion User Manual.pdf
       Updated Windows/k4companion-installer.exe
       Updated Windows/k4companion.exe
   
    bugfix: Do not re-send a frequency rcvd from the K4
       We were echoing back change frequency commands (FA$) received from the
       K4. This caused problems. We no longe do so.
       
       Also fix the lower frequency limit. The K4 caught this, so no harm
       was caused, but now it's fixed.
       
       Also fix the format of the sent FA$ commands. Again, the K4 accepted
       what we sent, but now we conform to the spec.
   
    Use our own stderr file descriptor
       We briefly close FD 2 while using pyaudio to avoid its voluminous
       output to stderr. However, other threads may want to print debug output
       during those brief periods. So, we print using our own file descriptor
       dup'ed from FD 2.
   
